{"ok":true,"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_E2EXf_00168","versions":[{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_E2EXf_00168","release":"R20-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_E2EXf_00168","release":"R21-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_E2EXf_00168@rel:R22-11#c02aecd3","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_E2EXf_00168","release":"R22-11","content":"{DRAFT} If DataTransformationStatusForwarding is set to transformerStatusForwarding and PXX is P01, P02, P04, P05, P06, P07, P08, P11, P22 or P44 the function E2EXf_<transformerId>() shall invoke E2E_PXXForward(), passing to that function the appropriate Config and State structures (see [SWS_ E2EXf_00125] and [SWS_E2EXf_00126]) that are associated with <transformerId>, as well as buffer and bufferLength (only for P04, P05, P06, P07, P08, P11, P22 and P44) that were updated in above requirements SWS_E2EXf_00108, SWS_E2EXf_00109, SWS_E2EXf_00115, SWS_E2EXf_00111. In addition, the E2E status shall be passed on to the E2E_PXXForward() func- tion based on the parameter forwardedCode provided by the RTE. This param- eter is associated with the optional IN parameter forwardedCode from Rte_Write (SWS_Rte_01071), Rte_Send (SWS_Rte_01072), Rte_IWrite (SWS_Rte_03744) and Rte_IWriteRef (SWS_Rte_05509). The forwardedCode must be mapped to the match- ing E2E status (see Table 7.1).","meta":{"trigger_kind":"multi_release_ingest","source_pdf":"AUTOSAR_SWS_E2ETransformer.pdf"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-01T10:13:22+00:00","text_key":"404e9a6ed631"},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_E2EXf_00168","release":"R23-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_E2EXf_00168","release":"R24-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}},{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_E2EXf_00168","release":"R25-11","text_captured":false,"meta":{"trigger_kind":"pdf_presence","source":"classic_upstream"}}],"lifecycle":{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/CP/record/SWS_E2EXf_00168","is_dropped":false,"first_active_release":"R20-11","last_active_release":"R25-11","dropped_in":[],"first_dropped_release":null,"absent_before":["R19-11"],"platform_releases":["R18-10","R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"latest_platform_release":"R25-11","text_releases":["R22-11"],"presence_only":["R20-11","R21-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"unchecked":["R18-10"]},"element":{"kind":"requirement","name":"","module":"E2EXf","cluster":"","page":"","doc_type":"SWS","ai":false,"first":"R20-11","last":"R25-11","changed":[],"distinct":1,"universe":"CP"},"evidence":{"figures":[{"id":"FIG-b87cb21b178017c9","doc":"AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_E2ETransformer","p":35,"rel":[],"role":"heuristic","conf":0.9,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"E2EXf invokes E2E_PXXForward on transformerStatusForwarding","n":5,"cap":"Figure 7.8: E2EXf_handling_specific_protection","sha":"b87cb21b178017c970cd10f6375c9ce9bcd40c2bd11a1e9c997e43d62d7bc4b6","nser":1,"src":"figure"},{"id":"FIG-b4bcc6e18e715900","doc":"AUTOSAR_SWS_E2ETransformer","p":25,"rel":[],"role":"heuristic","conf":0.85,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"E2EXf invoke E2E_PXXForward","n":7,"cap":"Figure 7.1: E2EXf_<transformerId>function overview","sha":"b4bcc6e18e7159002844e680e69f49dd33bc08b5065b5329a61e8814437c819d","nser":1,"src":"figure"},{"id":"FIG-08e3b6bf0f427c53","doc":"AUTOSAR_CP_SWS_E2ETransformer","p":91,"rel":[],"role":"heuristic","conf":0.8,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"E2EXf invoking E2E_PXXForward for status forwarding","n":5,"cap":"Figure 9.10: E2E sequence for signal to service translation (E2EXf_<TransformerId>)","sha":"08e3b6bf0f427c5347abae7ed571a4a93715faa75c4dc80e4d619afc0d553931","nser":3,"src":"figure"}],"snippets":[],"cited_in":[],"cited_total